      "primaryHotelId": null,
      "name": "The Corner Hotel",
      "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Luxurious Accommodation with Pool and Bar</strong></p><p><strong>Outdoor Swimming Pool &amp; Terrace</strong>: Enjoy a relaxing dip in the outdoor swimming pool or unwind on the terrace while taking in the stunning views of Barcelona.</p><p><strong>Modern Amenities</strong>: Each room at The Corner Hotel is equipped with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV, and a private bathroom with luxurious bathrobes and slippers, ensuring a comfortable stay.</p><p><strong>Central Location</strong>: Located just 1.1 km from Casa Batllo, with popular attractions like Passeig de Gracia and Plaça Catalunya nearby, The Corner Hotel is the perfect choice for travelers interested in exploring the city.</p><p>Experience luxury and convenience at The Corner Hotel. Book your stay now to enjoy a memorable experience in Barcelona.</p>",
