      "id": "lp3723e",
      "primaryHotelId": null,
      "name": "Barcelona Princess",
      "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Spectacular Views and Free Amenities</strong></p><p>Located just a 10-minute walk from the beach, Barcelona Princess Hotel in the city’s Forum area offers stunning views and a complimentary gym for guests. The hotel boasts two heated outdoor pools, with the one on the 23rd floor providing breathtaking sea views.</p><p><strong>Elegant Rooms and Dining Options</strong></p><p>The rooms at Princess Barcelona are elegantly designed with contemporary décor and feature amenities like satellite TV. Guests can enjoy Mediterranean cuisine at the hotel's restaurant and unwind at one of the two stylish bars, including a poolside bar with panoramic views.</p><p><strong>Convenient Location and Easy Access</strong></p><p>Situated on Avenida Diagonal, next to Diagonal Mar Shopping Centre, Princess Hotel Barcelona offers easy access to transportation with the tour bus stopping in front of the hotel and a nearby metro station. Explore top attractions like Plaza de Catalunya and Las Ramblas within a 15-minute metro ride. Book your stay now and experience the best of Barcelona!</p>",
