      "id": "lp39f8e",
      "primaryHotelId": null,
      "name": "Olivia Plaza Hotel",
      "hotelDescription": "<p><strong>Central Location &amp; Stunning Views</strong><br>The Hotel Olivia Plaza, located on Plaza Catalunya, offers magnificent views of Santa Ana Church. Just steps away from the vibrant Ramblas, guests can immerse themselves in the heart of Barcelona's bustling city life.</p><p><strong>Luxurious Amenities &amp; Dining Experience</strong><br>Indulge in stylish rooms equipped with modern comforts like a flat-screen TV, free Wi-Fi, and a complimentary safe. Start your day with a buffet breakfast at Nineteen restaurant, serving delectable Mediterranean cuisine.</p><p><strong>Fitness &amp; Relaxation</strong><br>Guests enjoy complimentary access to Holmes Place Urquinaona gym, including the pool area and fitness room. After exploring the nearby Gothic Quarter, unwind on the terrace bar with a refreshing drink and panoramic views.</p><p>Book your stay at Hotel Olivia Plaza for a perfect blend of luxury, convenience, and unforgettable experiences in Barcelona.</p>",
